  "name": "Question 7",
  "problem": "Evaluate the following limit:\n\n${lim}_{x\\to -3}\\sqrt[3]{7x-6}=$\n{{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=-3$ into the expression, and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -3}\\sqrt[3]{7x-6} & =\\sqrt[3]{7(-3)-6} \\\\  & =\\sqrt[3]{-27} \\\\  & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
